# AI-assistant working files stay local — none of them belong on GitHub
# (2026-09-08). The shareable guidance they used to carry (repo layout,
# notebook conventions, verification recipes, tooling hazards) now lives
# in the README.md files, which are the published documentation.
CLAUDE.md*
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider*

# Instructor answer keys — untracked 2026-09-07. Kept on disk locally,
# never committed: this repo is public and students read it. The
# labNN_student.md companions stay tracked.
weekly_lectures/*/lab*_instructor.md

what_to_do.txt
what-to-do.txt
*.log
*.webarchive
.venv/
__pycache__/
.DS_Store

# Marimo writes a session cache next to any notebook you open with
# `marimo edit`. Regenerated on demand — never commit it.
__marimo__/

